      "claim": "Caffeine is a central nervous system stimulant that blocks adenosine receptors, increasing alertness.",
      "evidence": "Pharmacology textbooks and reviews describe caffeine’s antagonism of adenosine receptors as its primary mechanism of action.",
      "weight": 0.10,
      "depends_on": []
